Boot loader
-----------
The bootable ISO (build/radiant-x64.iso and docs/download/radiant-x64.iso) is
assembled by grub-mkrescue and therefore contains unmodified binaries of
GNU GRUB 2, Copyright (c) Free Software Foundation, Inc., licensed under the
GNU General Public License version 3 or later. The binaries come from the
Ubuntu grub2 packages (grub-pc-bin, grub-efi-amd64-bin); the corresponding
source is available from https://www.gnu.org/software/grub/ and from
https://launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/grub2. GRUB is a separate program that
loads the RadiaNT kernel; it is not linked with it.
